                                "sense_id": "f5c84cf8-71ea-3490-bde6-eb6dcf2dd266",
                                "text": "Hydropots and aquabibs are epithets bestowed by the champions of alcohol in London upon the temperance folk."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "454e6915-af9b-4e62-84ee-397b66ad0af5",
                                "sense_id": "f5c84cf8-71ea-3490-bde6-eb6dcf2dd266",
                                "text": "Dwight L. Moody and John B. Gough, the great aquabib, had commanded attention […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5aed6a8-e637-4d47-a75a-a963c4b62f9b",
                                "sense_id": "f5c84cf8-71ea-3490-bde6-eb6dcf2dd266",
                                "text": "While its more sober counterpart was directed to quite different ends by a pugnacious aquabib, William Henry Draper"
